arious recipes.", "HARINA DE PATATAS:Potato flour is another gluten-free substitute that can be used in cooking and baking.", "HARINA DE ARROZ:Rice flour is a gluten-free flour option that is often used in gluten-free recipes.", "ALMIDÓN DE PATATA:Potato starch is a gluten-free thickening agent that can be used in cooking.", "HARINA DE SOJA:Soy flour is a gluten-free alternative that is high in protein and can be used in various recipes.", "HARINA DE TRIGO:", "DIETA CONTROLADA EN GLUTEN:The \"DIETA CONTROLADA EN GLUTEN\" is a dietary regimen that excludes foods containing gluten. This diet is primarily recommended for individuals with celiac disease, a condition that necessitates strict avoidance of gluten to prevent adverse health effects. It is utilized mainly by those diagnosed with this condition to manage their symptoms and maintain overall health.", "ALIMENTOS SIN GLUTEN:\"ALIMENTOS SIN GLUTEN\" refers to foods that do not contain gluten, making them safe for consumption by individuals with celiac disease. These gluten-free foods are specifically designed to meet the dietary needs of those who cannot tolerate gluten, ensuring their health and well-being.", "HARINAS DE TRIGO:Las harinas de trigo son un ingrediente básico en muchos productos de panadería y contienen gluten, lo que las hace inapropiadas para personas con enfermedad celiaca.", "BOLLOS:Los bollos son productos de pastelería que generalmente contienen gluten y deben ser evitados por personas con enfermedad celiaca.", "PASTAS ITALIANAS:Las pastas italianas, como fideos y macarrones, son alimentos que contienen gluten y deben ser evitados por personas con enfermedad celiaca.", "LECHE Y DERIVADOS:La leche y sus derivados son alimentos que no contienen gluten y son seguros para el consumo de personas con enfermedad celiaca.", "QUESOS FUNDIDOS:Los quesos fundidos de sabores pueden contener gluten y deben ser verificados antes de su consumo por personas con enfermedad celiaca."], "parameters": {"model": "